  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Audit of the project &quot;District Heating Cooperation for Technology Transfer (Poland)&quot;. The purposes of the audit are: to assess the handling of books and administrative procedures in the project by the Swedish party and to assess the handling of development cooperation means in an efficiency sense.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Revision av projektet &quot;District Heating Cooperation for Technology Transfer (Poland)&quot;. Revisionens syften &#xe4;r att fastst&#xe4;lla den svenska partens hantering av bokf&#xf6;ring och administrativa tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngs- s&#xe4;tt och att fastst&#xe4;lla hur man kan utnyttja utvecklingssamarbetets medel p&#xe5; ett effektivt s&#xe4;tt.</narrative>
  </description>
